# ============================================================================
# handoff role map — TEMPLATE
# ============================================================================
# Maps a canonical <org>/<repo> identity (as recorded in the handoff registry
# from `git remote get-url origin`) to a specialist role, so a session in that
# repo auto-arms the right domain lens on start.
#
# This file is a TEMPLATE. On first run the plugin copies it to your GLOBAL
# map at ~/.claude/handoff/roles.yaml — edit THAT file (or use
# `/handoff role set`), not this one. The plugin never overwrites your map.
#
# Tiers (first match wins, highest precedence first):
#   1. $HANDOFF_ROLES_YAML                          (env override, one file)
#   2. <repo-root>/.claude/handoff/roles.yaml       (PROJECT — commit to share
#                                                     a role with your whole team)
#   3. ~/.claude/handoff/roles.yaml                 (GLOBAL — your personal map)
#
# Format (flat YAML, parseable with `awk -F': *'`):
#
#   <org>/<repo>: <primary>[+<secondary>[+<secondary>...]]
#
# - <primary> selects the overlay lens roles/<primary>.md. The receiver also
#   reads specialist-prompt.md (the base contract) and applies it through the
#   lens.
# - Secondaries are additional languages/tools the receiver should be aware of.
#   If a roles/<secondary>.md lens exists it's referenced; otherwise the tool
#   is mentioned by name (the receiver is a senior engineer — they know what it
#   is, they just need to know it applies to THIS repo).
#
# Shipped lenses (have a roles/<name>.md): golang, rust, python, typescript,
#   blockchain-ts, devops, lua.
# Common name-only secondaries (no lens; mentioned by name): gha, hardhat,
#   foundry, zksync, terraform, ansible, gcp, aws, docker, k8s.
#
# Lens resolution also layers: a project/global roles/<name>.md overrides the
# shipped one, so you can ship custom lenses with your repo or keep personal
# ones in ~/.claude/handoff/roles/.
#
# Unmapped repos fall back to specialist-prompt.md alone (generic senior
# engineer). Add a mapping with: /handoff role set <role>
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Examples — replace with YOUR repos (delete these sample lines):
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# acme/payments-api:   golang+gha
# acme/web-frontend:   typescript
# acme/contracts:      blockchain-ts+hardhat+foundry
# acme/infra:          devops+terraform+ansible+gcp
# acme/engine:         rust+lua
